{"unit_id":"zengxiaolou__dsh-annotation#card-zh","repo":"zengxiaolou/dsh-annotation","commit":"a33584df1d5dab4269d03052703ba8a84e74b25a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-annotation 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的插件，用于给对话回答划选内容添加注释。它在会话消息尾部和输入框上方注册界面，并在本地页面保留选区与注释状态。用户可以划选回答、添加可选备注、编辑或删除批注，并将引用和备注作为草稿胶囊随消息发送；多条注释还可从输入框上方集中查看和清除。插件也能围绕选中文字提交一次性旁问，并把回答显示在原会话中。适合需要在长对话里引用回答并补充上下文的场景。注释仅保存在当前页面内存，刷新后消失；安装需使用兼容版本的 DSH。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1963-2006"]}
{"unit_id":"zengxiaolou__dsh-annotation#card-en","repo":"zengxiaolou/dsh-annotation","commit":"a33584df1d5dab4269d03052703ba8a84e74b25a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-annotation is a DSH web plugin for annotating selected answers. Its conversation and input dock controls let users quote text, add notes, edit or manage multiple annotations, and send them with a message. Users can also ask a one-off question about selected text and see the reply in that chat.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1963-2006"]}
