{"unit_id":"zengxiaolou__dsh-annotation#feature-1","repo":"zengxiaolou/dsh-annotation","commit":"a33584df1d5dab4269d03052703ba8a84e74b25a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-annotation 的功能「划选回答并添加批注」：在对话回答中选中文字后打开注释框，可输入备注或只保留引用；保存后原文位置显示高亮和编号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:355-380"]}
{"unit_id":"zengxiaolou__dsh-annotation#feature-2","repo":"zengxiaolou/dsh-annotation","commit":"a33584df1d5dab4269d03052703ba8a84e74b25a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-annotation 的功能「把注释作为草稿发送」：已保存的引用和备注写成输入框草稿中的注释胶囊，用户编辑消息并发送时一同带出。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:645-672"]}
{"unit_id":"zengxiaolou__dsh-annotation#feature-3","repo":"zengxiaolou/dsh-annotation","commit":"a33584df1d5dab4269d03052703ba8a84e74b25a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-annotation 的功能「集中管理多条注释」：同一会话有多条批注时，输入框上方显示注释入口，可查看条目、跳回引用位置或清除注释。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1880-1911"]}
{"unit_id":"zengxiaolou__dsh-annotation#feature-4","repo":"zengxiaolou/dsh-annotation","commit":"a33584df1d5dab4269d03052703ba8a84e74b25a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-annotation 的功能「对选中文本发起旁问」：从选区工具打开旁问并提交问题，插件基于当前会话上下文请求一次回答，再在发起它的会话显示结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:82-130"]}
{"unit_id":"zengxiaolou__dsh-annotation#caveat-1","repo":"zengxiaolou/dsh-annotation","commit":"a33584df1d5dab4269d03052703ba8a84e74b25a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-annotation 使用前须知：注释和旁问界面状态保存在当前页面内存，刷新页面后不会保留，也不跨设备同步（见 lib/client.js:72-84）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:72-84"]}
